("p", "**Trace the pathway when a hot object is touched:** thermal receptors in skin &rarr; sensory neuron &rarr; spinal cord (relay neuron) &rarr; motor neuron &rarr; arm muscles contract and the hand is withdrawn."),
("p", "**Why is a reflex arc useful?** Thinking time in the brain would be too long; in the spinal cord the path is short and fast."),
